Generate album cover mosaic from release images

Usage: mosaic [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --image-dir <IMAGE_DIR>    [default: web/public/img/releases]
      --output-dir <OUTPUT_DIR>  [default: web/public/img/labs]
      --mode <MODE>              [default: chronological]
      --manifest <MANIFEST>      
      --web                      
  -h, --help                     Print help
